@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Admin
actor Teller
actor Customer
actor "Notification Service" as NS

rectangle "Bank Management System" {
  usecase "Login" as Login
  usecase "Create staff user" as Create
  usecase "Deactivate user" as Deactivate
  usecase "Unlock user" as Unlock
  usecase "Freeze / unfreeze / close account" as Freeze
  usecase "View audit log" as Audit
  usecase "View daily report" as Report
  usecase "Send transaction notification" as Notify

  Create ..> Login : <<include>>
  Deactivate ..> Login : <<include>>
  Unlock ..> Login : <<include>>
  Freeze ..> Login : <<include>>
  Audit ..> Login : <<include>>
  Report ..> Login : <<include>>
}

Admin -- Login
Admin -- Create
Admin -- Deactivate
Admin -- Unlock
Admin -- Freeze
Admin -- Audit
Admin -- Report
Teller -- Login
NS -- Notify
Customer -- Notify : recipient

note bottom of Notify
BMS triggers a simulated notification after every debit or credit.
The Customer is the recipient. No real SMS/e-mail gateway is in scope.
end note
@enduml
